                    'A glory Thou dost give me, A treasure safe on high,',
                    'That will not fail nor leave me As earthly riches fly.',
                ],
            ],
            [
                'label' => 'Verse 5',
                'kind' => 'verse',
                'num' => 5,
                'lines' => [
